{"parentUuid":"1caf500f-4cf8-41b4-8125-a0971f0015fd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLwq7D4q88PBy5hTWELv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#764 is merged and the release branch is green at `b74edef0`. No PRs are open.\n\n**#764 (audit verification fails closed on recorded gaps)**\n- I reviewed this one myself, since it's 52 lines.\n- **What it closes:** three of the follow-ups I left on #763. `audit verify` now fails any bundle whose flight log holds a gap marker, including a skip on the very first record. The docs now state that a disk failure which also prevents the marker cannot be detected from the log alone, and that the stricter verifier can change the verdict on existing bundles.\n- **Checked:** the audit tests pass at its head and fail when the new check is disabled.\n\n**Still open from the flight-recorder reviews:**\n- One failed redaction ends chaining for the rest of the session.\n- A disk failure with no marker, followed by a restart, still reads as an intact chain. This is now documented rather than fixed.\n\n**Merged by me after review since the quota pause:** #758 through #764 (seven PRs).\n\n**What still stands between here and landing v1.3.0, unchanged**\n- **Unbuilt:** PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3, PA-2.\n- **Unfinished:** GV-1 slices 3–4, the GV-5 allowlists, the six VR-2 follow-ups.\n- **Yours:** which units roll to v1.4, then the go-ahead for the merge to `main` and the release-candidate tag."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1137,"cache_read_input_tokens":580039,"output_tokens":497,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1137,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"in